                                                "sense_id": "8908b427-1f99-3bd0-85cc-d5fe7e14b1a0",
                                                "text": "Betty — so stout, and with that rheumatism in her leg — did she ever think of herself? Or Aunt Rosamund, with her perpetual rescuings of lost dogs, lame horses, and penniless musicians?"
                                            }
